Package: com.r0gueee.aurora
Name: Aurora
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: Packaging
Priority: optional
Maintainer: r0gueee <r0gueee@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: firmware (>= 12.0)
Recommends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
Description: A modern package manager for jailbroken iOS
 Aurora is a Sileo successor: it reads Debian repositories directly, resolves
 dependencies itself, and stages every change in a reviewable queue before
 touching the system.
 .
 Highlights:
  * flat and dists repositories, rootless and rootful layouts
  * a real dependency resolver, not a dpkg frontend
  * a staged change queue with required/conflicting/suggested sections
  * a step-by-step transaction log you can cancel
 .
 mobilesubstrate is recommended, not required: a package manager must be able to
 install, remove and upgrade packages on a jailbreak that does not use
 substrate (ElleKit, libhooker, or no hooking library at all).
